{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":14},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.2,"end":28.16},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30,"end":39.76}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.8,"text":"網格為分離元素提供共同基準。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.44,"end":6.56,"text":"對齊讓讀者不用每個區塊都加框，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.76,"end":8.08,"text":"也能看出關係。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.8,"end":10.4,"text":"更多欄提供彈性，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.6,"end":14,"text":"但也可能讓文字區太窄而難以掃讀。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.2,"end":16.24,"text":"固定標題大小，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.72,"end":18.84,"text":"比較一欄和兩欄。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":19.2,"end":20.64,"text":"追蹤閱讀順序，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.12,"end":25.08,"text":"檢查相關細節是否有可見的對齊。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.92,"end":28.16,"text":"排版網格的主要用途是什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30,"end":32.32,"text":"排版網格的主要用途是什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.28,"end":36.88,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.36,"end":39.76,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}